      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "HUD（ノティフィケーション）縦揺れの軽減。\n現状のノティフィケーションは運動中など激しく動いてHMDが縦に激しく動いてるとき、とてもじゃないが文字を読むことができません。\nスムーシングは左右の動きにしか対応しておらず、かっこいいだけで実際あまり役に立ってるとは思いません。\n左右とは別に、上下用のスムーシングが欲しいです。",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-09-12T00:23:32.758Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Currently, when the HMD is moving vertically and violently, such as during exercise, it is impossible to read the text.\nSmoothing only supports left/right movement, which is cool, but I don't think it is actually very useful.\nI would like to have a separate smoothing for up and down, not left and right.",
